==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use mid-ranged attackers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] as your main offense, while spamming [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cats]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cats]] to protect them. When you have enough money, spawn a [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]].

